here. Present. And my body did what it was supposed to do.<br></strong><br>She said something that night I'll never forget: "I missed you."<br><br>She wasn't talking about distance. She was talking about the version of me that had disappeared — the man who didn't have to think about any of this.<br><br><strong>He came back.</strong></p><img alt="HMX_NTV_MG1_adv.png__PID:ff6f85ab-2772-4798-8424-cf985080bcea" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0632/7690/8587/files/HMX_NTV_MG1_adv_0eec342c-c13c-45c5-8b8d-445116bdb8bb.png?v=1771685951&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" deco